menu "MeshCore Watch power"
    config MCW_AUTO_LIGHT_SLEEP
        bool "Automatic light sleep while display and GPS are idle"
        default y
        help
            Allows ESP-IDF tickless idle to use light sleep when LoRa RX,
            touch IRQ and BLE are available, but screen and GNSS are idle.
            Turn off to retain dynamic frequency scaling without automatic light sleep.

    config MCW_CONNECTED_BLE_LIGHT_SLEEP
        bool "Allow automatic light sleep during idle BLE connections"
        depends on MCW_AUTO_LIGHT_SLEEP
        default y
        help
            Keep an authenticated BLE connection while permitting the ESP32-S3
            to enter automatic light sleep between BLE controller events.
            NimBLE/controller PM locks still protect active radio events.
            If a phone exhibits connection instability, disable this option.
endmenu
